### ==============================================================================
### Colección de Pruebas HTTP: Incident Enrichment & Dispatch Microservice
### Base URL: http://localhost:8001
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8001
@apiKey = titan-secret-key-2026

### 1. Monitoreo de Salud del Servicio (Público)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json


### 2. Evaluar y Despachar Incidente - ÉXITO (Protegido con X-API-Key)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/incidents/evaluate-and-dispatch
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "camera_id": "CAM-CDMX-PERIFERICO-04",
  "incident_type": "colision_critica",
  "confidence": 0.94,
  "telemetry": {
    "initial_speed_kmh": 78.5,
    "impact_speed_kmh": 0.0,
    "delta_time_sec": 0.38,
    "has_fire": false,
    "has_smoke": true
  },
  "latitude": 19.3012,
  "longitude": -99.1824,
  "detected_plate": "ABC-1234",
  "frame_snapshot_url": "https://storage.incidentdetector.io/snapshots/20261021/snap_cam04_9921.jpg"
}


### 3. Evaluar y Despachar Incidente - ERROR 401 UNAUTHORIZED (Sin Header X-API-Key)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/incidents/evaluate-and-dispatch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "camera_id": "CAM-CDMX-PERIFERICO-04",
  "incident_type": "colision_critica",
  "confidence": 0.94,
  "telemetry": {
    "initial_speed_kmh": 78.5,
    "impact_speed_kmh": 0.0,
    "delta_time_sec": 0.38
  }
}


### 4. Evaluar y Despachar Incidente - ERROR 401 UNAUTHORIZED (Key Inválida)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/incidents/evaluate-and-dispatch
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: clave_incorrecta_xyz

{
  "camera_id": "CAM-CDMX-PERIFERICO-04",
  "incident_type": "colision_critica",
  "confidence": 0.94,
  "telemetry": {
    "initial_speed_kmh": 78.5,
    "impact_speed_kmh": 0.0,
    "delta_time_sec": 0.38
  }
}


### 5. Evaluar y Despachar Incidente - ERROR 400 BAD REQUEST (Validación sin Stack Trace)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/incidents/evaluate-and-dispatch
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "camera_id": "",
  "incident_type": "x",
  "confidence": 1.99,
  "telemetry": {
    "initial_speed_kmh": -20.0,
    "impact_speed_kmh": 500.0,
    "delta_time_sec": -1.0
  }
}


### 6. Consultar Expediente Situacional por ID - ÉXITO (Público)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/incidents/INC-2026-004812/dossier
Accept: application/json


### 7. Consultar Expediente Situacional - ERROR 404 NOT FOUND
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/incidents/INC-INEXISTENTE-9999/dossier
Accept: application/json


### 8. Consultar Riesgos Ambientales y Meteorología - ÉXITO (Público)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/environmental-hazards?lat=19.4326&lon=-99.1332&has_fire=false
Accept: application/json


### 9. Consultar Riesgos Ambientales - ERROR 400 BAD REQUEST (Coordenadas Inválidas)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/environmental-hazards?lat=999.0&lon=-99.1332
Accept: application/json

